 Tests 
 Procedure 
 Determine that an empty error container with role=alert or aria-live=assertive attribute is present in the DOM (Document Object Model). at page load. 
 Trigger the error that causes the content in the live region to appear or update. 
 Determine that the error message was injected into the already present error container. 
 Expected Results 
 #1 and #3 are true. 
